
# TMR Self-Healing Digital System

## Overview
This project demonstrates Triple Modular Redundancy (TMR)
using Verilog HDL. Three logic outputs are combined using
a majority voter to tolerate a single faulty output.

## Objective
To demonstrate fault masking in a digital circuit using
redundant logic modules and majority voting.

## Architecture
- Logic Module 1
- Logic Module 2
- Logic Module 3
- Majority Voter
- Fault Injection Signal

## Working Principle
Three logic modules perform the same AND operation.
The majority voter produces the value agreed upon by at
least two modules.

A fault signal can invert the third module's output.
When the other two modules agree, the voter can preserve
the correct output.

